   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": null,
   "text": "Result: all 2,158 calls refused, the cache sat empty, and the memory check never fired. Fix (future work):\nlet a probe call through now and then, drift the rate back when idle, use vLLM's own prefill time.\nThe 10-K team on the same small cache: 10 pauses, cache 99\u2013100% full, finished in 2.5 min with citations.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 51,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Result: all 2,158 calls refused, the cache sat empty, and the memory check never fired. Fix (future work):\nlet a probe call through now and then, drift the rate back when idle, use vLLM's own prefill time.\nThe 10-K team on the same small cache: 10 pauses, cache 99\u2013100% full, finished in 2.5 min with citations.",
   "lineHeight": 1.15
  },
